===Pronoun===
{{head|is|pronoun|cat2=indefinite pronouns}}

# [[one]], [[you]]
#: {{ux|is|'''Maður''' gerir þetta svona.|'''You''' do it like this./'''One''' does it like this.}}

====Usage notes====
The pronoun ''maður'' declines as the noun, but cannot take the definite article. It is placed in a clause in the same way as the noun, but the difference is in the stress: as a pronoun, it never takes the main stress in a sentence. It also cannot be substituted with the pronoun {{m|is|hann}} due to being a pronoun itself.

